ter，value=\"1号\"。\\n- “今天新增客户数”：新增属于指标修饰词，不输出维度。', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': '{\"rewritten_question\":\"2026年6月30日店铺100011的总下单客户数是多少？\",\"metric_mentions\":[\"总下单客户数\"],\"time_mentions\":[\"2026年6月30日\"],\"inherited_context\":{},\"available_dimensions\":[{\"name\":\"商家ID\",\"aliases\":[\"商家\"],\"data_type\":\"bigint\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"档口ID\",\"aliases\":[\"店铺\",\"档口\",\"门店\"],\"data_type\":\"bigint\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"未发订单号\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"string_label\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"客户ID\",\"aliases\":[\"客户\"],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"客户名称\",\"aliases\":[\"客户\"],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"string_label\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"超时天数\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"int\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"是否超时\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"tinyint\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"商品摘要，仅用于展示\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"text\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"string_label\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"商品ID\",\"aliases\":[\"商品\"],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"货号\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"string_label\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"商品名称\",\"aliases\":[\"商品\"],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"string_label\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"未销售天数\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"int\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\":\"numeric_id\",\"is_time\":false},{\"name\":\"交易渠道，如线上或线下\",\"aliases\":[],\"data_type\":\"varchar\",\"semantic_type\":null,\"value_kind\